      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POWER SQUEEZE (1) isn't a quick beginner but comes home hard, finishing out of the frame two back but did wind up strongly to place when second (34.42) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. One of the leading chances. ULENTA BALE (2) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but had to settle for a minor placing when a 4 length third over 595m at this track, clocking 34.55. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Will give a great sight again. PAW QUINBY (7) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (34.85) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning seven races. Worth following up. TRUMPET TEARS (8) has been freshened and can sneak into the frame on his best form.",
